    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an unforgettable adventure in <i>GoopUp</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world filled with mysterious hats, each granting unique powers that unlock hidden pathways and help you overcome the world\u2019s obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to strategize and solve mind-bending puzzles woven into the fabric of <i>GoopUp's</i> world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/10289a324c1f8e32e14dc19f222c1f6d.poster.avif?t=1744620563\" width=624 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/10289a324c1f8e32e14dc19f222c1f6d.webm?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/10289a324c1f8e32e14dc19f222c1f6d.mp4?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hats with Powers</strong> \u2013 Discover and equip different hats to alter gameplay and reveal secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/0fc844a20346bb82809f20574c3fc482.poster.avif?t=1744620563\" width=176 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/0fc844a20346bb82809f20574c3fc482.webm?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/0fc844a20346bb82809f20574c3fc482.mp4?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong> \u2013 You can only move while airborne, adding a fresh but limiting twist to classic platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/7c9e6f3939c3200519b0ec46a0d36b2c.poster.avif?t=1744620563\" width=592 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/7c9e6f3939c3200519b0ec46a0d36b2c.webm?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/7c9e6f3939c3200519b0ec46a0d36b2c.mp4?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Work together to navigate challenging levels and outsmart obstacles. <br><strong>Survive the Perils</strong> \u2013 Avoid spikes, water, and enemies\u2014losing all 4 hearts means <i>Game Over</i>. <br><strong>Diverse Level Design</strong> \u2013 Traverse eight expansive zones featuring horizontal and vertical sub-levels. <br><strong>Up to 2 Players</strong> \u2013 Bounce off each other to reach new heights and master cooperative movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to master the world of <i>GoopUp</i>? Jump in to defeat the terrible king!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/df5a5327b3b7e286cb39b2b7dea739c4.avif?t=1744620563\" data-has-big width=800 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an unforgettable adventure in <i>GoopUp</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world filled with mysterious hats, each granting unique powers that unlock hidden pathways and help you overcome the world\u2019s obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to strategize and solve mind-bending puzzles woven into the fabric of <i>GoopUp's</i> world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/10289a324c1f8e32e14dc19f222c1f6d.poster.avif?t=1744620563\" width=624 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/10289a324c1f8e32e14dc19f222c1f6d.webm?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/10289a324c1f8e32e14dc19f222c1f6d.mp4?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hats with Powers</strong> \u2013 Discover and equip different hats to alter gameplay and reveal secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/0fc844a20346bb82809f20574c3fc482.poster.avif?t=1744620563\" width=176 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/0fc844a20346bb82809f20574c3fc482.webm?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/0fc844a20346bb82809f20574c3fc482.mp4?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong> \u2013 You can only move while airborne, adding a fresh but limiting twist to classic platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/7c9e6f3939c3200519b0ec46a0d36b2c.poster.avif?t=1744620563\" width=592 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/7c9e6f3939c3200519b0ec46a0d36b2c.webm?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/7c9e6f3939c3200519b0ec46a0d36b2c.mp4?t=1744620563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Work together to navigate challenging levels and outsmart obstacles. <br><strong>Survive the Perils</strong> \u2013 Avoid spikes, water, and enemies\u2014losing all 4 hearts means <i>Game Over</i>. <br><strong>Diverse Level Design</strong> \u2013 Traverse eight expansive zones featuring horizontal and vertical sub-levels. <br><strong>Up to 2 Players</strong> \u2013 Bounce off each other to reach new heights and master cooperative movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to master the world of <i>GoopUp</i>? Jump in to defeat the terrible king!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/df5a5327b3b7e286cb39b2b7dea739c4.avif?t=1744620563\" data-has-big width=800 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
